## Feature 概述

**名称**: `system.board.navigation`（不带 @1.0）

**用途**: 将物理按键事件暴露给 Quick App，用于页面导航

**导航映射**:
- Back 按键 → 向左切换页面
- Home 按键 → 回到首页
- Menu 按键 → 向右切换页面

## 实现架构

### 1. JIDL 接口定义

**文件**: `frameworks/runtimes/feature/modules/jidl/navigation.jidl`

```
module system.board.navigation

const NAVIGATION_TYPES = {
    LEFT = 0,
    HOME = 1,
    RIGHT = 2
}

struct NavigationEvent {
    int type
    long timestamp
    bool longPress
    int duration
}

struct SubscribeOptions {
    callback onNavigate_cb onNavigate
    callback onError_cb onError
    bool enableLongPress = true
    int longPressThreshold = 500
}

struct ButtonStatus {
    bool backPressed
    bool homePressed
    bool menuPressed
    long lastEventTime
}

struct StatusQueryParams {
    callback onSuccess_cb onSuccess
    callback onError_cb onError
    callback onComplete_cb onComplete
}

callback onNavigate_cb(NavigationEvent event)
callback onError_cb(string message, int code)
callback onSuccess_cb(object data)
callback onComplete_cb()

void subscribe(SubscribeOptions options)
void unsubscribe()
ButtonStatus getButtonStatus()
void getStatus(StatusQueryParams params)
promise simulateNavigation(int type)
```

### 2. C++ 实现

**文件**: `frameworks/runtimes/feature/modules/navigation_impl.cpp`

**关键代码结构**:
```cpp
#include "navigation.h"
#include "feature_config.h"
#include "feature_exports.h"
#include "feature_log.h"

#include <uv.h>
#include <fcntl.h>
#include <unistd.h>
#include <sys/ioctl.h>
#include <sys/time.h>
#include <errno.h>
#include <time.h>

#include <nuttx/config.h>
